// The character classes, asked of a source position rather than of a byte.
//
// `while(is_digit(character_code_at(src, i)))` says what it means and is no longer
// legal: a call may not be an argument to a call (docs/SPEC.md 7.1), and the
// obvious repair -- naming character_code_at's value before the loop -- would compute it
// once where the loop needs it every iteration. So the composition becomes a
// function, which is what a loop condition wanted to be anyway.

is_name_start_at(string src, int i) {
  int code = character_code_at(src, i);
  int start = character_is_name_start(code);
} return int start;
("a", 0):(1)
("_", 0):(1)
("5", 0):(0)
("", 0):(0)
